{"id":"wb-7-804","name":"前万户汤王庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"前万户汤王庙","text":"前万户汤王庙，位于山西省长治市长子县丹朱镇万户村。\n\n正殿建于元代，有元代斗拱和壁画。\n\n2013年3月5日，前万户汤王庙公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，古建筑类，时代为元，编号7-0804。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%89%8D%E4%B8%87%E6%88%B7%E6%B1%A4%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%99","revisionId":86786014,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86786014","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null,"textScope":"body-excerpt"}